      "latestValidation": "Batch six statistics storage checks passed under COUNT_AST_OPERS (12/12) and MEASURE_BLOCK_SIZE (5/5). Full Core Debug passed 17,281/17,281 and Release passed 15,552/15,552. The LoopHoistingTests debug label now expects MUL, matching pinned optimizer.cpp. The committed residual tree has 36 tracked JIT .h/.hpp/.cpp files outside other/; this physical inventory includes shells and files with dependent declarations. The prior smallest-file slice was reviewed in full: only five storage definitions were eligible for retirement; other headers remain pending their native consumers/implementations.",
