        "JIT32 header/pointer-table serialization and MEASURE_PTRTAB_SIZE counter writes are ported. JIT32 DUMP_GC_TABLES decoding and formatting are now represented in managed code, and gcencode.cpp/jitgcinfo.h are retired. The shared gcdump/inc helpers remain native outside the JIT retirement scope; no x86 end-to-end execution or generated-code parity is claimed.",
